# Generated Artifacts

- `dist/` is `tsc` output — edit `src/`, then `npm run build`
- Do not commit or hand-edit `*.tgz`; examples use directory `file:` dependencies
- Treat committed Expo/iOS native trees as generated where possible — prefer JS/TS and config changes
- If CI publish fails on version conflicts, bump `package.json` version intentionally rather than republishing the same version
